        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `object_metadata.py` that reads object metadata or head information from managed object storage, I will use the AWS S3 service as the concrete external provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a specific provider and make it identifiable in the code. The AWS S3 service is widely used for object storage, and its Python SDK, `boto3`, will be used to interact with the service. </thinking>\n",
