    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create a Python script that generates a time-limited signed download URL for a stored object using a concrete external provider, I will use Amazon S3 as the provider. The script will use the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with Amazon S3. The script will generate a presigned URL that allows anyone to download a specific object from an S3 bucket for a limited time. </thinking>\n",
